{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy idle cafe management that keeps you company while you work. Grow fresh ingredients, cook, and serve delicious food to adorable animal customers. Build your dream cafe that sits at the bottom of your screen. <strong> </strong> <br><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Grow Fresh Ingredients</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant and harvest crops from your little farm to create the freshest meals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/Steam_GIF_Farming_no_border.gif?t=1749043517\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build your dream cafe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design, decorate, and customize your perfect cafe to match your unique style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/Steam_GIF_Deco_no_border.gif?t=1749043517\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cook &amp; Serve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn fresh ingredients into delicious meals and earn money to buy decoration or upgrade your cafe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/Steam_GIF_Kitchen_no_border.gif?t=1749043517\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Playing while working</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your friendly staff will take care of the cafe, keeping things running smoothly while you work, study, or relax.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167540/extras/Steam_GIF_Bottom_of_the_screen_no_border.gif?t=1749043517\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Twitch &amp; Streaming integration</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect to your stream and turn your stream into 